---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Contact Pangaea · Adam Pang's Publication"
  description="Contact Adam Pang about Pangaea for corrections, questions about published work, or a possible recorded conversation."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>
    Pangaea is Adam Pang's personal publication. For a factual correction, a question about a
    published essay, or a possible recorded conversation, use the public contact details on
    Adam's own about page. That page is the canonical contact point for Pangaea and Adam's other
    independent work.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="https://adampang.com/about#how-to-reach-me">
      Contact Adam about Pangaea
    </a>
  </p>

  <h2>Before writing</h2>
  <p>
    Pangaea has no on-site contact form, reader accounts, paid plan, or subscription desk. A
    message does not enroll anyone in a mailing list, and there is no guaranteed response time.
    Public corrections may be reflected in the relevant page when they can be verified.
  </p>

  <p class="meta">
    Read <a href="/about/">About Pangaea</a> or review the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
